      579.95
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 63 of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) No. 16 of 1907, as amended by Act, No. 13 of 1966 (reprint), No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009,1 do by this notification notify that the Palakuda Reserved Mangrove Forest mentioned in the above order is subjected to the sole control of the Conservator General of Forests.",
